"密码盘组合空间 30 × 60 = 1800 种（约 10.8 bit），能挡住随手翻看，挡不住有时间暴力尝试的人；已配合阶梯锁定。密码忘记后无法找回。\n\n保险箱文件以普通格式存放在 App 沙盒，受 iOS 沙盒与系统文件保护；App 密码只保护界面访问，不提供独立的文件加密。旧版加密文件仍可在原设备上读取，但不会参与 iCloud 同步。\n\niCloud 同步为 VIP 功能且默认关闭，只同步标准文件到你的 iCloud 私有数据库；密码与锁定状态始终只留在本机，每台设备各自设置密码。" = "The dial combination space is 30 × 60 = 1800 (about 10.8 bits). It deters casual snooping, not a patient brute-force attempt; escalating lockouts provide additional protection. A forgotten combination cannot be recovered.\n\nVault files are stored in plain format in the app sandbox and protected by iOS sandboxing and system file protection. The app password only guards interface access; it does not provide separate file encryption. Legacy encrypted files remain readable on their original device but are not synced to iCloud.\n\niCloud sync is a VIP feature and is off by default. It syncs ordinary files to your private iCloud database; your combination and lock state stay on this device, with a separate combination per device.";
